<title>UK: Fitch says to open Hong Kong office by September.</title>
<headline>Fitch says to open Hong Kong office by September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. rating agency Fitch Investors Service plans to open an office in Hong Kong by September, a Fitch official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will open a Hong Kong office this year, no later than September,&quot; Neil Baron, vice chairman at Fitch, told Reuters. Baron was in London for a Fitch structured finance conference.</p>
<p>The office will be staffed by three people, Baron said, although no decision had yet been taken on who would be its head.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
